    "title": "Mansfield City Council OKs plan to repave 5.7 miles of Ohio 13 for $2 million - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Carl Hunnell ,\n7 hours ago MANSFIELD — Mansfield lawmakers on Tuesday authorized the administration to seek bids for a $2 million, 5.7 mile repaving project this year on the city’s north side. City engineer Bob Bianchi said the Ohio Department of Transportation will provide $1.25 million for the project. The city will pay the remaining $750,000 from a combination of permissive sales tax, street funds, water funds and sewer funds. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
